{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36441","headline":"谢友人遗华阳巾 · 罗邺","name":"谢友人遗华阳巾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剪露[裁]烟胜角冠，来从玉洞五云端。\n醉宜薤叶欹斜影，稳称菱花子细看。\n野客爱留笼鹤髪，溪翁争乞配渔竿。\n真仙首饰劳相寄，尘土飜慙戴去难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}